// Diagnostic matrix: for each NY reporting date (same order as dKey) x session (0 Asia, 1 NY morning, 2 NY afternoon, 3 outside any
// window) x DGN columns. Layout: 0 eligible bars, 1 bars fully covered, 2 bars with 15m bias UNKNOWN, 3-6 context inversions 1m/2m/3m/5m,
// 7 contexts admitted, 8 retested, 9 candidates, 10 formed-after-context, 11 overlap, 12 impulse, 13 stop/risk, 14 clear path,
// 15 admission, 16 entries, 17-29 first failed gate (17 formed-before, 18 no overlap, 19 impulse, 20 stop/risk, 21 HTF coverage,
// 22 3m structure not ready, 23 HTF gap, 24 3m swing, 25 window instance, 26 session limit, 27 unresolved setup, 28 bias, 29 outranked),
// 30 inversion before retest, 31 inversion on retest candle, 32-37 inversion rejected (32 bias unknown, 33 bias opposite, 34 narrow,
// 35 other inversion chosen, 36 unresolved-setup lock, 37 no window), 38-42 context lost (38 replaced, 39 discarded at another entry,
// 40 window expiry, 41 closed through, 42 bias flip), 43 informational (candle-1 before confirmation), 44-49 impulse FIRST failed
// sub-check (dir, body/ATR, body/range, close position, extension, unavailable), 50-54 impulse sub-check failed at all, 55 bars with an open setup.
// TAP DIAGNOSTIC (no entries): 56 HTF gaps tapped on the chart candle (any direction), 57 taps of a gap in the bias direction,
// 58 unused, 59 ARMED (bias known, in window, VWAP + EMA agree), 60 not armed: VWAP disagrees, 61 not armed: EMA disagrees,
// 62 tap while already armed, 63 / 64 1m / 2m inversions strictly after the tap (trigger candidates), 65 inversions that straddle
// the tap, 66 inversions in another window instance, 67 / 68 trigger candidates with VWAP+EMA still agreeing / not agreeing,
// 69 arms ended by window end or bias flip without an inversion, 70 not armed: VWAP / EMA unavailable.
var array<int>    dg = array.new_int(0)
